# Environment variables for getupp-website.
# Copy relevant values into .env.local (gitignored) for local development.

# --- Vercel ---
# VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN is generated automatically by the Vercel CLI when the
# project is linked (`vercel link`) or via `vercel env pull`. No action needed.

# --- Supabase (not yet wired up; reintroduce with the waitlist form) ---
